        {
          "text": "Ore te siadi nena wikii ntomoni ile o are neiwuang'ieki ilo otubukokoki eilata aaput, ilo kitok nemeitoki aata toki, ore lelo tung'ana le ilo kitok olotu neidaikie ina anasa o ewueji sinyati. Kelotu enkiting'oto enye anaa to loirrag le nkarenetii olarrabal o metabaiki enkiting'oto; neibalunyekiemijoonisho. ",
